  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意</span></p>\n<p>若要為<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">'<a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stay True</a>'</span>資源包新增發光礦物層，必須搭配使用 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">OptiFine</span> 或 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">若要在<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">'<a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stay True</a>'</span>資源包中啟用礦物發光效果，請務必搭配 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">OptiFine</span> 或 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></span> 模組使用</span></p>",
